# round B95 (w254): the forest's out-of-fold read of the GO neighbor mean as a ONE-column store on the w167 recipe (linear affine, log1p, zero init). The store is INDUCTIVE: a random forest fit on the training genes' labels reads the GO neighbor mean (annotation of the deleted gene's coexpression and union neighbors, no phenotype), out of fold on the training genes (five folds, leaf 5 selected on validation, val Pearson 0.314), full-train prediction for every other gene (target_forest_stack_store.py, results/target_forest_stack_store_YPD_bx_gonbrforest.json). Rounds 226 to 228 read the same columns through the affine at 0.145 to 0.221 against the forest's 0.279; this hands the model the forest's read itself. Paired against w167 and w245 by seed. Six seeds at 36 GB.
